{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-04-14 00:47:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE INC. ANNOUNCES PRICING OF EQUITY UNITS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., APRIL 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) ("NISOURCE") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS PRICED ITS OFFERING OF 7,500,000 SERIES A EQUITY UNITS ("EQUITY UNITS"), INITIALLY CONSISTING OF 7,500,000 SERIES A CORPORATE UNITS ("CORPORATE UNITS"), EACH WITH A STATED AMOUNT OF $100.'}